。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16945","sourceWorkId":"4391","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"峡谷を拠点としている魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"怪力の持ち主だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度の恥ずかしがり屋なため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲に迷惑をかけることが多い"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"（本人に悪気はない）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"パニックになるとドラゴンに変身して、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"手がつけられなくなる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛い顔して"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非道いことをつぶやいたりするが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"やっぱり本人に悪気はない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……はっ！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"こっち見ないでくださいぃ～」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188254"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5ddca0f05705a76ae33c7f29c79314c0947d95a35b56d56052ce4eabf4f0818b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fe/fede6610cea60c9a539a9949e4097f70d8975d921a847013f155c8db9dcde4bd.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"アヤ","creatorId":"vndb:s13883","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s13883","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s13883","name":"アヤ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17392","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c36880","characterName":"メイシア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188257","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"92117"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16948"],"vndbCharacterId":"c36880"},"originalCharacterName":"メイシア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は幼い少女だが、この世界で最大の宗教「ネーノイス教」における高位の神官。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女もまたフェルザーの侵略に対して、大きな壁となって立ちはだかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神族の末裔でもある彼女は、聖なるオーラで包まれており、悪しき魔族が触れようとするとそのオーラの力で弾かれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また幼い頃から厳しい修行の日々を過ごしてきたことから法力は一流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それ故か、無口で、無愛想で無感情、他人と接することが苦手で、一人でいることが多く、"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16948","sourceWorkId":"4391","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"最大宗教である、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネーノイス教の高位な神官で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界征服を進めていくフェルザーの前に"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立ちはだかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼いころより日々修行をさせられてきたため、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"法力は一流。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"他人とコミュニケーションをとるのが下手で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人との関わりを避けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神族の末裔で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"神聖なオーラのようなものをまとっており、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族が触れると電気が走ったように"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バチッとはじかれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「………」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188257"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7feff902ec90540233c04eb738277f0fc0ae80889d7ceffca8da53caacd1e77d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88c687c102d9891c9c5bb88f7c2e7a96ad752e5abe9840a4642c37fdb4d1d491.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杏露 花梨","creatorId":"vndb:s2925","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2925","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2925","name":"杏露 花梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17382","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c36881","characterName":"セレス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188256","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"92117"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16947"],"vndbCharacterId":"c36881"},"originalCharacterName":"セレス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界征服を進めるフェルザーに立ちはだかる人間族の女勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい見た目に反して、内には激しく熱い魂を秘めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間に対しては柔らかい態度だが、魔族に対しては、激しい憎悪をぶつけてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一度決めたことは貫き通す頑固さを持ち、性格も真面目。故に、曲ったことが大嫌い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16947","sourceWorkId":"4391","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は可愛いらしいが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"内には熱く激しいものを持っている女勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世界征服を進めていくフェルザーの前に"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"立ちはだかる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間に対しては柔らかい態度をとるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔族に対しては憎しみをぶつけてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頑固で真面目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"曲がったことは許せない性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お前だけは……許せない！！　」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188256"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70f71b5e12b8ed60f6348fa73cf8d94eb3f643ff004c475f7a73c976f77eb8fd.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/39/394ed0cfde176ce3fc1f7d35797b117d405ac970922c1e202261eab7ebf9a89d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17366","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c36882","characterName":"モモ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"188255","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"92117"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16946"],"vndbCharacterId":"c36882"},"originalCharacterName":"モモ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"草原を拠点にする魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おバカで、天真爛漫で能天気、明るく騒がしい元気な女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を見つけると奇声をあげながら、強烈なタックルを食らわしてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネコっぽい容姿だが、中身はバカ犬（？）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分を天使だと信じている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16946","sourceWorkId":"4391","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"草原を拠点としている魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おバカで、元気で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何も悩みがなさそうな女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公を見つけると、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「にゃーーーーっ！！」というかけ声とともに、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強烈なタックルをしかけてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は猫だが、中身はバカ犬。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分のことを天使だと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あちょおおおおっ！！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"188255"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/68/68cb40ab0aa9567e77daa06ba5e9569b32e141380876a35ba1764ebba15e0b57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/7524f0b9f7221ca7fbf72c718a564cdf26eefa32c5d74bdb9fbcf8606a95ca6b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"渋谷 ひめ","creatorId":"vndb:s354","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s354","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s354","name":"高村 優里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17370","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c36883","characterName":"ユキネ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"209718","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"92117"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16949"],"vndbCharacterId":"c36883"},"originalCharacterName":"ユキネ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"白の国を統べる、いわゆる雪女。魔族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪を自由に操る力を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪女だけに、クールビューティーだが、その内には激しさがあり、感情が昂ぶると吹雪が起こる。"},{"spoi